    "title": "TimelyCare Health & Well-being",
    "description": "TimelyCare, by TimelyMD, is the leading virtual health and well-being solution providing equitable, on-demand access to mental health support and medical care.\r\n\r\nUsing the TimelyCare app or website, enjoy virtual mental health and wellness visits via call or video, as well as 24/7 access to doctors, counselors, nurse practitioners, and other professionals. All visits are 100% confidential and secure.\r\n\r\nTimelyCare also offers free meditation, yoga, and other self-care content, including discussions and guidance from experts.",
